        "记忆伦理",
        "主动遗忘"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:memory_passport",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "memory_passport",
      "summary": "记录本次运行保留的 memory classes、遗忘的 memory classes、policy、reset memory 状态和不可逆遗忘标志。",
      "tags": [
        "记忆",
        "审计"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:forgetting_ledger",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "forgetting_ledger",
      "summary": "逐项记录被遗忘的 memory class、policy、reset 状态和伦理理由。",
      "tags": [
        "遗忘",
        "审计"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:irreversible_forgetting_statement",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "irreversible_forgetting_statement",
      "summary": "声明 author_decision、strategy_preference、final_wording 不得从 checkpoint、cache、retrieved cases、旧 final report 或历史 summary 中重构。",
      "tags": [
        "遗忘",
        "不可逆遗忘声明"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:cross_run_author_decision_forgetting_test",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "cross_run_author_decision_forgetting_test",
      "summary": "跨运行回归测试：旧作者选择 A 不会变成下一轮默认答案，后一轮必须重新证据驱动或 decision_deferred。",
      "tags": [
        "测试",
        "跨运行",
        "跨运行旧决策不复用"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:three_supplemental_acceptance_gates",
      "type": "concept",
      "name": "三点补充落地要求",
      "summary": "本轮计划的硬性验收门：不可逆遗忘声明、跨运行旧决策不复用回归测试、中文伦理解释进入用户可见报告。报告必须包含“遗忘不是能力损失，而是保护作者主体性的边界。”",
      "tags": [
        "验收门",
